  "statement": "# Beacon Relay — task brief\n\nThis is a design target, not an implementation specification. Build your own GDD, scene structure, rules, and code.\n\n## Target player experience\n\nCross a readable 3D traversal course, use movement to activate or reach a sequence of beacons, and finish the relay.\n\n## Scope boundary\n\nA compact third-person 3D platformer with spatial progression, recoverable falls or failure, and an explicit final completion state.\n\n## Creative freedom\n\nYou may choose the course topology, movement tuning, beacon rule, checkpoints, and scenic composition.\n"
